OL,3,GNEWSAKnife laws 'deflection tactic' in
OL,4,ANowak case failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office is using knife laws as
OL,7,Fa "deflection tactic" to distract from
OL,8,Fpolice "failings" after the murder of
OL,9,FHenry Nowak, a Sikh group has said.
OL,11,FVickrum Digwa was jailed for life for
OL,12,Fstabbing 18-year-old student Nowak with
OL,13,Fa large dagger in Belmont Road,
OL,14,FSouthampton, on 3 December 2025.
OL,16,FThe Sikh Federation accused ministers
OL,17,Fof "inappropriately targeting" the
OL,18,Fkirpan, a sacred religious blade.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
