OL,3,GNEWSAKnife laws 'deflection tactic' in
OL,4,ANowak case failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood
OL,7,Fsignalled she is considering a change
OL,8,Fto knife laws after Nowak's father Mark
OL,9,Fcalled for a clearer definition in law
OL,10,Fof what a Sikh kirpan looks like.
